# Creates Keyed-Runs/Unleashed-Testnet in one `op-remote create` (an item is created once, whole).
# Never run as a command: the run templates (testnet-l1, testnet-generation, apps/tools/testnet-faucet)
# each take only their own fields from this item.
# The L1 key is the only funded one; PLAN_PINNED_L1_SIGNERS.testnet must name its address. Both L2
# deployers pay through the SponsoredFPC.
# op: generate eth-key
PRIVATE_KEY=op://Keyed-Runs/Unleashed-Testnet/PRIVATE_KEY
# op: import
SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=op://Keyed-Runs/Unleashed-Testnet/SEPOLIA_RPC_URL
# op: generate hex32
BRIDGE_DEPLOYER_SECRET_TESTNET=op://Keyed-Runs/Unleashed-Testnet/BRIDGE_DEPLOYER_SECRET_TESTNET
# op: generate fr
DEPLOYER_SECRET_KEY=op://Keyed-Runs/Unleashed-Testnet/DEPLOYER_SECRET_KEY
# op: generate fr
DEPLOYER_SALT=op://Keyed-Runs/Unleashed-Testnet/DEPLOYER_SALT
